# Flyby Web Environment Variables
#
# Copy this file to .env and adjust values for your local setup.
# Vite automatically loads variables prefixed with VITE_.

# Base URL for the Flyby API (backend server).
#
# Leave UNSET for local dev and E2E: the app calls the API with relative
# paths (/api, /v1) which the Vite dev server proxies to localhost:3001
# (see the proxy block in vite.config.ts).
#
# Set it ONLY when the app is built to run against an API on a different
# origin (e.g. the production static deploy): the build then bakes the
# absolute base into every fetch/EventSource call.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001
